(4841936, 701793, 76526, '<td valign="top">The fog is a nice touch - however due to the color in the ski and reflection off the river I feel as if it gives off a warmth rather than a "cold" shot. Good shot though</td>', 'The fog is a nice touch - however due to the color in the ski and reflection off the river I feel as if it gives off a warmth rather than a "cold" shot. Good shot though', '2008-07-23 22:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
