(4841962, 702106, 76526, '<td valign="top">I was pregnant once and craved wendys french fries in their chocolate shakes - this picture brings back memories.</td>', 'I was pregnant once and craved wendys french fries in their chocolate shakes - this picture brings back memories.', '2008-07-23 22:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
