(4841967, 700335, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  It is very difficult to make out if there is snow on the ground or what.  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and consider it to be snow and very cold.  However, the image itself is very static looking and has no real focal point of interest to draw in the viewer.  The front tree on the left side of the image makes it difficult to look deeper into the woods, even on the right side of the image, as my eye keeps being dragged back to the tree on the left.  Hope my comments help in some way. <br/> <br/>Tim</td>', 'Back to comment:  It is very difficult to make out if there is snow on the ground or what.  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and consider it to be snow and very cold.  However, the image itself is very static looking and has no real focal point of interest to draw in the viewer.  The front tree on the left side of the image makes it difficult to look deeper into the woods, even on the right side of the image, as my eye keeps being dragged back to the tree on the left.  Hope my comments help in some way.  Tim', '2008-07-23 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
