(4843385, 702205, 90387, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail this looks kinda plane, but I really like it in full size.  The composition and strong colors make the can look like it''s popping out of my screen!  Very nice job.</td>', 'From the thumbnail this looks kinda plane, but I really like it in full size.  The composition and strong colors make the can look like it''s popping out of my screen!  Very nice job.', '2008-07-24 19:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
