(4846851, 701882, 90495, '<td valign="top">Makeup is applied well and her look is solemn. I feel her <i>iceolation</i>, I almost tremble for her. What bothers me is the lighting. It''s not moody enough to give off that feeling you were looking for, I think. Putting the left side of her face in deep shadow and darkening the background could have achieved that feeling of isolation or desolation.</td>', 'Makeup is applied well and her look is solemn. I feel her iceolation, I almost tremble for her. What bothers me is the lighting. It''s not moody enough to give off that feeling you were looking for, I think. Putting the left side of her face in deep shadow and darkening the background could have achieved that feeling of isolation or desolation.', '2008-07-27 19:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4846856, 702097, 90495, '<td valign="top">Yummy colourful freeze pops. Simple and well done.</td>', 'Yummy colourful freeze pops. Simple and well done.', '2008-07-27 19:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
