(4850605, 702018, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like it, and got the connection to "cold" immediately.  Your puns are very amusing, and I like "C''est la vie" vs. "C''est le morte" in your comments. :)<br/> <br/>My only suggestion on the picture itself would be to crop off some stuff on the right so the turtle''s centered.  I usually prefer subjects off-center, but here the centered bit would be the shell, with interesting parts poking off into other areas.</td>', 'I like it, and got the connection to "cold" immediately.  Your puns are very amusing, and I like "C''est la vie" vs. "C''est le morte" in your comments. :) My only suggestion on the picture itself would be to crop off some stuff on the right so the turtle''s centered.  I usually prefer subjects off-center, but here the centered bit would be the shell, with interesting parts poking off into other areas.', '2008-07-30 01:47:42.000000', NULL, 0),
