(4851619, 702018, 30982, '<td valign="top">Didn''t vote this challenge, but did do a quick look-through and stopped to view this one.  Makes me sad.  Wonder if he died a natural kinda death, since these guys live a very long time.  They''re rather distinguished creatures and this view shows that in death we''re all laid bare - naked, if you will.  A very somber picture; sad, but presented with class and reverence.</td>', 'Didn''t vote this challenge, but did do a quick look-through and stopped to view this one.  Makes me sad.  Wonder if he died a natural kinda death, since these guys live a very long time.  They''re rather distinguished creatures and this view shows that in death we''re all laid bare - naked, if you will.  A very somber picture; sad, but presented with class and reverence.', '2008-07-30 17:19:54.000000', NULL, 0),
