(4863506, 702229, 20577, '<td valign="top">I really think this shot was very underrated. The technique is great. I think if you focus on shots like this you will really get them down and start scoring much higher. However, I know you are artsy fartsy, so you probably don''t want to limit yourself to one type of photography. That''s cool... I totally understand that and I think it''s good not to box yourself into one specific genre. Seriously man, you have talent and you shouldn''t bog yourself down with just one thing. Spread your wings and soar buddy. Don''t be afraid to tackle other things. If you want to take a picture of cow dung then DO IT! Who cares what other people think! This site is about growing as an artist and you have limitless boundaries if you just free your mind. Be free man... BE FREE!</td>', 'I really think this shot was very underrated. The technique is great. I think if you focus on shots like this you will really get them down and start scoring much higher. However, I know you are artsy fartsy, so you probably don''t want to limit yourself to one type of photography. That''s cool... I totally understand that and I think it''s good not to box yourself into one specific genre. Seriously man, you have talent and you shouldn''t bog yourself down with just one thing. Spread your wings and soar buddy. Don''t be afraid to tackle other things. If you want to take a picture of cow dung then DO IT! Who cares what other people think! This site is about growing as an artist and you have limitless boundaries if you just free your mind. Be free man... BE FREE!', '2008-08-04 09:06:13.000000', NULL, 0),
